<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-WOMEN'S PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third round results in the $450.000</p>
<p>Paris Open women's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>3-6 6-3</p>
<p>3-Anke Huber (Germany) beat 5-Irina Spirlea (Romania)</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
<p>2-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat 8-Mary Pierce (France) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Nathalie Tauziat (Fra) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
</text>
